### 5. Fazer Login do ciclista (Armazena o token automaticamente)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "santiago@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}

### 6. Consultar cliente por ID (rota privada)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 7. Listar cliente (rota privada)
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 8. apgar cliente (rota privada)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/4
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}


### 9. atualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
   "nome": "Gabriel",
    "email": "Gabriel@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "endereco": "244", 
    "celular": "47999999999"
}




### Cadastrar console para testar o agendamento (ajuste idCliente)
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "modelo": "PlayStation 5",
    "marca": "Sony",
    "numeroSerie": "PS5-TESTE-001",
    "tipo": "Manutencao",
    "idCliente": 1
}

### Cadastrar agendamento (ajuste os codigos conforme o banco)
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-11-10",
    "hora": "14:00",
    "tipoServico": "Limpeza",
    "idCliente": 1,
    "idConsole": 1
}

### Listar agendamentos sem ordenar
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### Atualizar agendamento (ajuste o codigo na URL)
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-11-11",
    "hora": "15:00",
    "tipoServico": "Troca de pasta termica",
    "idCliente": 1,
    "idConsole": 1
}

### Campo obrigatorio ausente - esperado 400
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-11-10",
    "hora": "14:00",
    "idCliente": 1,
    "idConsole": 1
}

### Atualizacao sem campos obrigatorios - esperado 400
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{}

### Agendamento inexistente - esperado 404 (use um codigo inexistente)
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/999999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-11-11",
    "hora": "15:00",
    "tipoServico": "Limpeza",
    "idCliente": 1,
    "idConsole": 1
}

### Cliente ou console inexistente - esperado 500 (chave estrangeira)
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-11-11",
    "hora": "15:00",
    "tipoServico": "Limpeza",
    "idCliente": 999999,
    "idConsole": 999999
}

### Sem token - esperado 401
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
